  "title": "Vertiv Announces Commencement of Secondary Offering of 20,000,000 Shares of Common Stock by VPE Holdings, LLC, an affiliate of Platinum Equity, LLC",
  "summary": "August 7, 2023 – Vertiv Holdings Co (“Vertiv”) (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced the commencement of an underwritten secondary offering of up to 20,000,000 shares of Vertiv’s Class A common stock by VPE Holdings, LLC (“Platinum”), an affiliate of Platinum Equity, LLC, pursuant to an effective registration statement on file with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”) and Platinum’s registration rights agreement with Vertiv.",
